Read AGENTS.md and skills/REGISTRY.md first (route natural-language requests via the Intent Router in skills/REGISTRY.md without forcing `/setup` for standalone tasks; progressive disclosure: load a full skill body only when its trigger matches the current phase). Use docs/chat-commands.md for `/demo`, `/quick-tailor`, `/setup`, `/daily-run`, `/tailor-cv`, `/apply-url`, `/weekly-report`, `/linkedin-growth`, and `/profile-update`.

Route `/demo` to `.agent/workflows/demo.md` (no personal data or browser login), `/quick-tailor` to `.agent/workflows/quick-tailor.md` (1 CV + 1 JD, no browser login), `/setup` to `skills/00-interrogate-and-onboard.md` + `skills/01-resume-ingestion.md`, `/daily-run` and `/apply-url` to `skills/00-daily-run.md`, `/tailor-cv` to `skills/03-tailor-resume-and-verify.md`, `/linkedin-growth` to `skills/linkedin-growth.md` + `skills/05-outreach-and-interview-prep.md`, `/profile-update` to `skills/profile-intelligence-engine.md`, and `/weekly-report` to `skills/06-log-and-insights.md`. Connect optional Playwright MCP and Notion MCP using `mcp/mcp.template.json`. Respect `dry_run: true`, verified facts only, caps, and explicit job-specific human `APPROVE` before every live Submit.
